---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const links = [
  { label: '下载三服预览版 v0.2.0-alpha.2', primary: true, url: import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GROWTH_DOWNLOAD_URL || 'https://github.com/stonesver/ournotes-growth-exporter/releases/tag/v0.2.0-alpha.2' },
  { label: '查看 GitHub 源码', primary: false, url: import.meta.env.PUBLIC_GROWTH_SOURCE_URL || 'https://github.com/stonesver/ournotes-growth-exporter' },
].filter(link => typeof link.url === 'string' && /^https:\/\//.test(link.url));
---
<BaseLayout title="养成导入与本地工具">
  <section class="content-shell export-guide-page">
    <section class="ui-sheet export-hero-card">
      <div class="export-hero-copy">
        <h2>本地养成导出工具</h2>
        <p>本地读取游戏养成并生成 JSON 文件，再导入至「我的养成」供全站配队与算分工具共用。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="export-actions">
        <button type="button" class="ui-btn-soft" data-account-hub-open data-account-hub-services="growth" aria-haspopup="dialog">直接使用网页账号同步</button>
        {links.map(link => (
          <a href={link.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class={link.primary ? 'ui-btn-primary' : 'ui-btn-outline'}>
            {link.label}
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <ol class="export-steps">
      <li class="ui-subsheet">
        <span class="export-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <div>
          <strong>下载并启动本地包</strong>
          <p>下载并解压。Windows 打开 <code>Start.cmd</code>，Mac 打开 <code>Start.command</code>。包内已附 SDK 应用配置，启动后即可登录，无需另行获取配置。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="ui-subsheet">
        <span class="export-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <div>
          <strong>选择区服并导出 JSON</strong>
          <p>选择账号所属区服（港澳台、EN 或韩服），输入 BHK 邮箱、密码，读取后下载养成 JSON。该区服须已有角色。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="ui-subsheet">
        <span class="export-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <div>
          <strong>在网站导入并保存养成</strong>
          <p>回到网站选择同一区服，在配卡工具「我的卡库 · 从游戏导入我的养成」选择 JSON，预览后应用。</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>

    <section class="ui-sheet export-notes-card" aria-label="安全与兼容性说明">
      <h3>说明与注意事项</h3>
      <p>本地工具的密码不经过本站，JSON 仅在浏览器解析。也可直接网页登录：密码会经本站服务器处理，不保存密码或令牌。</p>
      <p>旧版 v0.1.0-alpha.3 及更早的本地包仅支持港澳台，请更新后再读取 EN 或韩服。v0.2.0-alpha.1 用户建议更新并完整解压，以恢复内置配置。Google 游戏授权尚未接通。</p>
      <p>非官方工具，存在账号限制风险；登录可能使游戏会话失效，遇到额外验证会停止。导入后请核对数据及缺失项目。</p>
      <p>支持 Windows x64、Mac Apple Silicon。Mac 版尚未完成 Apple 公证，不支持 Intel Mac。用完后关闭工具终端即可退出。</p>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
.export-guide-page {
  display: grid;
  gap: 16px;
  padding-top: 8px;
  padding-bottom: 48px;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
}
.export-hero-card {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 20px;
}
.export-hero-copy {
  display: grid;
  gap: 6px;
  max-width: 60ch;
}
.export-hero-copy h2 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 18px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--theme-text);
}
.export-hero-copy p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--theme-muted);
}
.export-actions {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
}
.export-actions a {
  text-decoration: none;
  min-height: 36px;
  padding: 6px 16px;
}
.export-steps {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 12px;
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}
.export-steps > li {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);
  align-items: start;
  gap: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
}
.export-step-num {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: var(--theme-action-soft);
  color: var(--theme-accent);
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
}
.export-steps strong {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--theme-text);
}
.export-steps p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--theme-muted);
}
.export-steps code {
  padding: 1px 6px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  border: 1px solid var(--theme-border-soft);
  background: var(--theme-surface);
  color: var(--theme-text);
  font: 12px var(--font-mono);
}
.export-notes-card {
  display: grid;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 18px 20px;
}
.export-notes-card h3 {
  margin: 0 0 2px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--theme-text);
}
.export-notes-card p {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--theme-muted);
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .export-steps {
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
  }
}
</style>
